libinput handles keyboards, mice, touchpads and other input devices for wayland
compositors such as swc. Built against libudev-zero (no udev daemon), libevdev and
mtdev; without libwacom, the debug GUI, tests and docs. Installs libinput, headers,
libinput.pc, the libinput command and its helper tools under /usr/local.
The source is the Ubuntu archive's copy of the upstream release tarball
upstream: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/libinput/
